flowchart LR
    LAN[Law firm LAN] -->|HTTPS| RP[Reverse Proxy]
    RP --> APP[Resurrect X App]
    APP --> INF[Local Inference GPU]
    APP --> IDX[Local Search / Index]
    APP --> AUD[(Audit Store)]
    IDX --> NAS[(NAS Source Mount - Read Only)]
    APP --> OUT[(Output Store - Scoped Write)]
    MGMT[Management VLAN / Local Console] --> ADMIN[Maintenance Mode]
    ADMIN --> APP
    APP -. Explicit exception only .-> EGRESS[Controlled Egress Proxy]
